:name: Open reference ECU on STM32F407
:description: Runs synthetic ESC telemetry and safe UDS services over a Linux vcan bridge

using sysbus

$bin ?= @build/reference_ecu.elf
$canInterface ?= "vcan0"

mach create "open-reference-ecu"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/boards/stm32f4_discovery.repl
sysbus LoadELF $bin

emulation CreateCANHub "canHub"
connector Connect sysbus.can1 canHub
machine CreateSocketCANBridge "socketcan" $canInterface
connector Connect socketcan canHub

start

